# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.

# Supabase project URL — Dashboard → Project Settings → Data API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# Publishable (anon) key — safe to expose to the browser
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Service-role key — SECRET. Full RLS bypass. Server-side only, never NEXT_PUBLIC_.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Public base URL, no trailing slash. Fallback used by lib/site-url.ts when the
# request carries no trusted host — keeps signup confirmation emails pointing at
# the real domain instead of localhost.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://stopandgrowkc.org

# Resend API key — SECRET. Used by lib/email.ts for mail the app sends itself
# (the post-confirmation welcome). Supabase Auth sends the confirmation email
# separately, using its own copy of this key in the dashboard SMTP settings.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Cloudflare Access application tag for stopandgrowkc.org. Pins /Admin JWT
# verification to THIS app — without it, a token minted for any other app in the
# account would verify here. Not a secret. Only used while the site is served
# through the tunnel; delete it when deployment moves to Vercel. If unset,
# lib/access.ts ignores the Access header and falls back to Supabase + is_admin().
CF_ACCESS_AUD=61ebf7aa724c8fb4c358f641237116aad5461b2c6a33dd6d5fcb6fc4e20d9afb

# Extra hosts lib/site-url.ts will trust when building confirmation-email links.
# Comma-separated, host[:port] only — no scheme, no path. Leave UNSET normally.
#
# Exists for the Vercel move: a deploy is reachable at its own *.vercel.app name
# before DNS points at it, and a signup started there would otherwise build its
# confirmation link from the production fallback — a domain that may still point
# at the old origin mid-cutover, so the link leads nowhere.
#
# Anything listed here must ALSO be added to Supabase Auth → URL Configuration,
# or the link is rejected at their end instead of ours.
# EXTRA_ALLOWED_HOSTS=stop-and-grow-kc.vercel.app
